# Walkthrough: Wrestling Lobby & Round Table UI

Implemented the `/lobby` route with a real-time Round Table UI, the `Wrestler` and `WrestlingCard` database models in Prisma, default 20-card allocation per user, database seeding of 22 authentic wrestlers, and WebSocket multiplayer presence.

## Summary of Changes

### 1. Database Schema & Seeding (Prisma)
- **`server/prisma/schema/wrestling.prisma`**:
  - `Wrestler` model: `name`, `alias`, `tier` (`Legend`, `Champion`, `Superstar`), `attack`, `defense`, `speed`, `hp`, `finisher`, `avatar`.
  - `WrestlingCard` model: belongs to `User` (`userId`), has a direct wrestler relation (`wrestlerId`, `wrestler`) and many-to-many wrestler relation (`wrestlers: Wrestler[]`).
- **`server/prisma/schema/auth.prisma`**:
  - Added `cardList WrestlingCard[]` to `User` model.
- **`server/prisma/seed.ts`**:
  - Seeded 22 authentic wrestlers (The Undertaker, The Rock, Stone Cold Steve Austin, John Cena, Roman Reigns, Brock Lesnar, Triple H, Shawn Michaels, etc.).
  - Auto-assigned 20 default cards to seeded user.

### 2. Backend Services & REST Endpoints
- **`server/src/services/wrestling.service.ts`**:
  - `ensureWrestlersSeeded()`: Ensures all 22 dummy wrestlers are in the database.
  - `assignDefaultCardsToUser(userId)`: Ensures the user has 20 default wrestling cards in their `cardList`.
  - `getUsersWithCards()`: Returns users with their `cardList` containing 20 wrestling cards and wrestler relations.
  - `getAllWrestlers()`: Returns the full wrestling roster.
- **`server/src/api/routes/wrestling.routes.ts` & `app.ts`**:
  - Mounted `/api/wrestling`:
    - `GET /api/wrestling/wrestlers`: Returns all wrestlers in the database.
    - `GET /api/wrestling/users`: Returns users with `cardList` populated with 20 default cards.
    - `POST /api/wrestling/assign-default/:userId`: Ensures a specific user receives their 20 cards.
- **`server/src/api/controllers/company.controller.ts`**:
  - `getCompanyUsers` now includes `cardList` with wrestler relations.
- **`server/src/api/controllers/auth.controller.ts`**:
  - `signup` automatically calls `assignDefaultCardsToUser` on user creation.

### 3. WebSocket Real-time Multi-user Presence
- **`server/src/realtime/board/room-manager.ts` & `server/src/realtime/websocket/server.ts`**:
  - Enhanced `ClientMeta` and `PresenceUser` to include `cardCount` and `avatar`.
  - `handleJoinMessage` supports joining `"lobby"` and broadcasting presence updates with user card counts to everyone at the table.
- **`shared/src/schemas.ts`**:
  - Exported `WrestlerSchema`, `WrestlingCardSchema`, and updated `PresenceUser` & `JoinRoomMsg`.

### 4. Frontend Route & Round Table UI
- **`frontend/src/app/lobby/page.tsx`**:
  - New route `/lobby`. Connects to WebSocket server in room `"lobby"`, listens for `presence:update`, loads user deck and roster.
- **`frontend/src/components/lobby/RoundTableLobby.tsx`**:
  - Rich circular Round Table Arena UI:
    - Calculates radial coordinates around the table (`cos(θ)`, `sin(θ)`).
    - Seated user pedestals with custom presence colors, glowing online status beacons, user names, role pills, and "(YOU)" indicators.
    - Empty chair placeholders for challengers.
    - Click any seat to open that user's 20-card deck.
    - Side drawer to inspect all connected & registered users with cards.
- **`frontend/src/components/lobby/WrestlerCardDeck.tsx`**:
  - Collectible card modal: Tier badges (Legendary Gold, Champion Crimson, Superstar Purple), stat progress bars (PWR, DEF, SPD, HP), finisher moves, search, and tier filters.
- **`frontend/src/middleware.ts`**:
  - Allowed `/lobby` for guests and authenticated users.

